> > +     u16 handle;
> > +     union {
> > +             struct {
> > +                     u8 port;
> > +             } i2c;
> > +     };
> > +};
>
> Why this complexity?
>

There is also an SPI interface on this adapter which will probably the
port information and maybe some additional information. Would you
prefer to add the union later, when we add the SPI driver?
